    <briefdescription>
<para>Credit event on a bond of a certain seniority(ies)/currency. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Represents a credit event affecting all bonds with a given \ seniority and currency. It assumes that all such bonds suffer \ the event simultaneously. Some events affect all seniorities and this has to be encoded through a different set of events of the same event type. The event is an actual realization, not a contractual reference, as such it contains only an atomic type. </para>    </detaileddescription>
    <location file="/experimental/credit/defaultevent.hpp" line="49" bodyfile="/experimental/credit/defaultevent.hpp" bodystart="49" bodyend="172"/>
